    "body": "# 🚀 EnvBoot v0.1.6 — Diagnostics, Auto-Sync & System Ignores\r\n\r\n### 🌟 What's New in v0.1.6\r\n\r\n- ⏳ **Interactive Setup Loader**: Added smooth progress spinners when applying contracts and injecting startup guards during `envboot init`.\r\n- 🛡️ **`ignore` Contract Field**: Added native support for ignoring system environment variables (such as `NODE_ENV`, `TZ`, `CI`) in `.envboot.json` and CLI drift scanners.\r\n- 📋 **Fail-Fast Script Recommendations**: `envboot init` now suggests tailored `package.json` scripts (`\"dev\": \"envboot check && vite\"`, `\"build\": \"envboot check && tsc -b && vite build\"`) so dev servers halt immediately on missing variables.\r\n- 🩺 **`envboot doctor`**: Comprehensive diagnostic health check for frameworks, package managers, `.env` files, and contract health.\r\n- 🔄 **`envboot sync`**: Automatically detects newly introduced codebase variables and synchronizes `.envboot.json` and `.env.example`.\r\n- 📁 **Zero-Dependency `.env` Parser**: Built-in parser for `.env`, `.env.local`, `.env.development`, `.env.production` supporting quotes, comments, and empty values.\r\n- 💥 **Fatal Browser Crashes**: Added support for halting client-side React / Vite execution with fatal errors and Vite error overlays when required variables are missing.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 📦 Quick Start & Usage\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Initialize with latest features\r\nnpx envboot@latest init\r\n\r\n# Run diagnostic health check\r\nnpx envboot@latest doctor\r\n\r\n# Synchronize contracts when variables change\r\nnpx envboot@latest sync\r\n\r\n# Fast pre-build / CI check\r\nnpx envboot@latest check\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ashishrbuilds/envboot/compare/v0.1.5...v0.1.6\r\n"
  },
