    "body": "# 🚀 EnvBoot v0.1.5\r\n\r\n### 🌟 What's New\r\n- **`envboot doctor`**: Comprehensive diagnostic scanner that inspects framework setup, `.env` files, package manager dependencies, contract health, and provides actionable recommendations.\r\n- **`envboot sync`**: Automatically detects new variables introduced in source code and syncs both `.envboot.json` and `.env.example` (`--yes` and `--prune` supported).\r\n- **Built-in `.env` Parser**: Seamlessly loads local `.env` and `.env.*` files (supporting quotes, exports, and comments) during `check` and `init`.\r\n- **Fatal Browser Crashes**: Added support for halting client-side React / Vite execution with fatal errors and Vite error overlays when required variables are missing.\r\n- **Improved Terminal Prompts**: Explicit keyboard navigation guide for interactive multiselect checkbox prompts.\r\n\r\n### 📦 Installation & Usage\r\n```bash\r\n# Diagnostic health check\r\nnpx envboot doctor\r\n\r\n# Sync newly added variables\r\nnpx envboot sync\r\n\r\n# CI / Dev script guard\r\nnpx envboot check\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ashishrbuilds/envboot/compare/v0.1.4...v0.1.5"
