    "body": "# 🚀 EnvBoot v0.1.1\r\n\r\n> **Your app shouldn't start with a broken environment.**\r\n\r\nAutomatically discover, configure, and validate environment variables with **zero runtime dependencies**.\r\n\r\n### ✨ Highlights\r\n\r\n* ⚡ **Zero Runtime Overhead**: 0 dependencies on Node.js, Bun, and Deno.\r\n* 🔍 **Auto Codebase Scanner**: Detects `process.env`, `Bun.env`, `Deno.env`, and `import.meta.env` usage.\r\n* 🎯 **Non-Invasive**: Keep writing native `process.env.DATABASE_URL` — no wrapper objects.\r\n* 🚀 **Smart Detection**: Detects entry points for Next.js, Vite, Express, NestJS, Bun & Deno.\r\n* 🔒 **CI/CD Drift Guard**: `npx envboot check` catches missing & stale env vars with zero secret leakage.\r\n* 📦 **Universal**: First-class support for **npm, bun, pnpm, yarn, and deno**.\r\n\r\n### ⚡ Quick Start\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nnpx envboot init\r\nimport envboot from \"envboot\";\r\nenvboot.init(); // Halts boot immediately if required env vars are missing\r\n```\r\n\r\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/ashishrbuilds/envboot/commits/v0.1.1\r\nnpm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/envboot"
